msgid "Architecture and data flow"
msgstr "架构与数据流"

msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

msgid "Module responsibilities"
msgstr "模块职责"

msgid ""
"The source-file classes describe configuration. The tool adapters translate Python calls into "
"native command plans. The shared executor handles processes, logs, failures and output checks; "
"the runtime selects how each child environment is initialized. A workspace supplies experiment "
"identity and records, rather than acting as a pipeline scheduler."
msgstr ""
"源文件类描述配置；工具适配器将 Python 调用转成原生命令计划。共享 executor 管理进程、日志、失败和输出检查，runtime 决定如何初始化子环境。workspace "
"提供实验身份与记录，不承担 pipeline 调度。"

msgid "Module responsibilities and managed command execution."
msgstr "模块职责与受管理的命令执行。"

msgid "Public building blocks"
msgstr "公开构件"

msgid "Module"
msgstr "模块"

msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

msgid "Main interfaces"
msgstr "主要接口"

msgid "``megalib_source/``"
msgstr "``megalib_source/``"

msgid "Read and edit one run/source in a Cosima source file."
msgstr "读取和编辑 Cosima 源文件中的一个 run/source。"

msgid "``MEGAlibSource``, ``RunConfig``, ``Source``"
msgstr "``MEGAlibSource``、``RunConfig``、``Source``"

msgid "``cosima/``, ``revan/``, ``mimrec/``"
msgstr "``cosima/``、``revan/``、``mimrec/``"

msgid "Prepare tool-specific flags, inputs and expected outputs."
msgstr "准备各工具的 flag、输入和预期产物。"

msgid "``Cosima``, ``Revan``, ``Mimrec``"
msgstr "``Cosima``、``Revan``、``Mimrec``"

msgid "``revan/analysis.py``, ``mimrec/analysis.py``"
msgstr "``revan/analysis.py``、``mimrec/analysis.py``"

msgid "Bind main configuration; Mimrec also binds primary data and components."
msgstr "绑定主配置；Mimrec 还绑定主数据及成分。"

msgid "Constructor-bound analysis definitions"
msgstr "构造时绑定的分析定义"

msgid "``execution/``"
msgstr "``execution/``"

msgid "Runtime startup, managed execution, workspace records and lineage."
msgstr "运行环境启动、受管理执行、工作区记录与来源链路。"

msgid "``MEGAlibRuntime``, ``SimulationWorkspace``, ``ExecutionResult``"
msgstr "``MEGAlibRuntime``、``SimulationWorkspace``、``ExecutionResult``"

msgid "``mimrec/results.py``, ``mimrec/_root_worker.py``"
msgstr "``mimrec/results.py``、``mimrec/_root_worker.py``"

msgid "Read selected ROOT histograms in a separate compatible Python process."
msgstr "在独立且兼容的 Python 进程读取选定 ROOT 直方图。"

msgid "``extract_spectrum``, ``extract_image``"
msgstr "``extract_spectrum``、``extract_image``"

msgid "``mimrec/workflows.py``"
msgstr "``mimrec/workflows.py``"

msgid "Compose extraction, imaging and spectrum calls for prepared components."
msgstr "为准备好的成分串联提取、成像与谱计算。"

msgid "``analyze_components``"
msgstr "``analyze_components``"

msgid ""
"``RunConfig`` does not execute Cosima. Revan and Mimrec keep native cfg bytes opaque: no XML "
"parsing, tag repair or resource-path rewriting is performed. Native setting names, file "
"interpretation and scientific cuts belong to MEGAlib. See :doc:`revan`, :doc:`mimrec` and "
":doc:`api/index` for the exact interfaces."
msgstr ""
"``RunConfig`` 不执行 Cosima。Revan/Mimrec 的原生 cfg 始终作为 opaque 字节输入，不解析 "
"XML、不修标签、不重写资源路径。参数名、文件解释和科学筛选由 MEGAlib 决定。精确接口见 :doc:`revan`、:doc:`mimrec` 和 :doc:`api/index`。"

msgid "From simulation to a localization result"
msgstr "从模拟到定位结果"

msgid ""
"The ordinary localization path is simulation, reconstruction, extraction, then image/spectrum "
"analysis. Prepared components are declared when constructing Mimrec; one ``extract_events()`` "
"call combines and selects them together with the primary TRA. No preliminary combination command "
"or intermediate combined TRA is required. External SIM/EVTA or TRA data can enter at the "
"appropriate stage."
msgstr ""
"通常的定位路径为模拟、重建、事件提取，再进行图像/谱分析。准备好的成分在 Mimrec 构造时声明；一次 ``extract_events()`` 将其与主 TRA "
"共同组合并筛选。无需预先组合或产生中间 combined TRA。已有 SIM/EVTA 或 TRA 可以从对应阶段接入。"

msgid "Native event products and in-memory scientific results."
msgstr "原生事件产物与内存中的科学结果。"

msgid ""
"Every arrow between managed results identifies an exact upstream execution and selected product. "
"A later operation uses the selected data; it does not inherit the previous command's "
"temporary configuration overrides. The current command's own baseline and overrides still apply."
msgstr "受管理结果之间的箭头表示精确上游执行及选定产物。后续操作使用筛选后的事件数据，不继承前一条命令的临时参数覆盖；当前命令自身的基准和覆盖仍然生效。"

msgid ""
"For example, use ``mimrec.spectrum(input_data=selected)`` to use a particular extraction. "
"Without an explicit input, the bound group queries its root manifest: unique successful "
"extraction, otherwise unique successful optional combination, otherwise its registered primary "
"input. Declared components must first have a successful extraction/materialization. Multiple "
"candidates raise an ambiguity error; neither a fixed task folder nor the latest file chooses the "
"input."
msgstr ""
"例如用 ``mimrec.spectrum(input_data=selected)`` 使用指定提取结果中的事件数据。省略显式输入时，绑定组查询根 "
"manifest：优先唯一成功提取，再唯一成功的可选组合，最后登记主输入。声明的成分须先有成功提取/物化。多个候选报歧义，不按固定 task 文件夹或最新文件选择。"

msgid ""
"The :doc:`localization notebook <tutorials/Localization_workflow>` demonstrates one trial. Its "
"random background window, direct TRA event count and CSV summary are research-script steps. They "
"do not introduce a general study scheduler."
msgstr ""
":doc:`定位 notebook <tutorials/Localization_workflow>` 展示一个 trial。随机背景窗口、直接 TRA 计数与 CSV summary "
"属于研究脚本步骤，不构成通用 study 调度器。"

msgid "One origin, multiple analysis branches"
msgstr "唯一 origin 与多分析分支"

msgid ""
"Each independent Cosima trial uses its own workspace. Within it, different Revan definitions can "
"share the simulation, and different Mimrec definitions can share a reconstruction. Image reconstruction and spectrum extraction can "
"reuse the same selected result."
msgstr "每个独立 Cosima trial 使用独立 workspace。其内不同 Revan 定义可共享模拟，不同 Mimrec 定义可共享重建；图像重建和能谱提取可以复用同一选定结果。"

msgid "Independent analysis definitions sharing explicit upstream data."
msgstr "不同分析定义共享明确的上游数据。"

msgid "Three different identifiers"
msgstr "三种不同标识"

msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "标识"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

msgid "Selection behavior"
msgstr "选择行为"

msgid "``analysis_id``"
msgstr "``analysis_id``"

msgid "Workspace-local data/configuration group within a stage."
msgstr "在 workspace 的某个 stage 内标识数据/配置组。"

msgid "Reopening restores and validates its definition."
msgstr "重开时恢复并校验定义。"

msgid "``task``"
msgstr "``task``"

msgid "Caller-chosen operation label; for Mimrec, an output directory label."
msgstr "由调用者命名的操作标签；Mimrec 中也是输出目录标签。"

msgid "It is not an execution ID or a fixed extraction-folder convention."
msgstr "不是 execution ID，也不是固定提取目录的约定。"

msgid "``execution_id``"
msgstr "``execution_id``"

msgid "UUID of one command invocation, including failures and reruns."
msgstr "一次命令调用的 UUID，失败和重跑也有独立身份。"

msgid "Results/references preserve the exact command and upstream products."
msgstr "结果/引用保留精确命令及上游产物。"

msgid ""
"Mimrec's ``revan_analysis_id`` identifies the upstream reconstruction; its own ``analysis_id`` "
"can differ. An explicit ``input_data`` result can identify the parent instead. If both are "
"supplied, they must agree with recorded lineage. Changed primary data, components or constructor "
"baseline settings require a different analysis definition, subject to the failed-group recovery "
"rule below."
msgstr ""
"Mimrec 的 ``revan_analysis_id`` 指上游重建，其自身 ``analysis_id`` 可以不同。也可用显式 ``input_data`` "
"结果精确指定父节点。两者同时提供时必须与真实来源一致。主数据、成分或构造基准改变需另一分析定义，但下文失败组恢复情形例外。"

msgid "Workspace and provenance"
msgstr "工作区与来源记录"

msgid ""
"All stages share one root manifest. Analysis directories group data and baseline settings, while "
"each native invocation keeps its own status, inputs, outputs and logs. Directories are created as"
" needed; temporary inputs are omitted here."
msgstr "所有 stage 共用根 manifest。分析目录组织数据和基准设置，每条原生命令独立保存状态、输入、输出和日志。目录按需创建；此处省略临时输入。"

msgid ""
"``working_space`` means this experiment root. ``result.workspace_dir`` returns the root, whereas "
"``result.output_dir`` identifies an analysis/stage directory. The root manifest contains "
"``origin``, ``groups`` and ``executions``; use ``result.record`` to read a particular execution "
"by ID. Same-workspace parents use ID links; cross-workspace inputs snapshot only the selected "
"record, leaving event products in place. Output reservations prevent historical names from being "
"overwritten, even when a previously recorded product was removed."
msgstr ""
"``working_space`` 指实验根。``result.workspace_dir`` 返回根目录，``result.output_dir`` 标识分析/stage 目录。根 "
"manifest 包含 ``origin``、``groups``、``executions``；用 ``result.record`` 按 ID 读取单条执行。同 workspace 父节点按"
" ID 关联，跨 workspace 只快照选定记录，事件产物留原位。输出预留防止历史文件名被覆盖，即使原实体产物已删除。"

msgid ""
"Constructors read and validate definitions without creating files or starting native tools. Short"
" manifest updates are locked and written atomically; native execution does not hold the lock. See"
" :doc:`workspaces` for reopening, explicit selection, legacy read-only layouts and recovery "
"conditions."
msgstr "构造只读取、校验定义，不创建文件或启动工具。manifest 短时更新加锁并原子写入，原生执行不持锁。重开、显式选择、旧只读布局和恢复条件见 :doc:`workspaces`。"

msgid "Runtime and environment separation"
msgstr "运行环境与进程隔离"

msgid ""
"The analysis Python environment and MEGAlib installation can use different Python versions. "
"Direct mode starts a tool in the current environment. Setup-script mode sources the supplied "
"script and executes the tool in the same Bash child. The caller's environment and working "
"directory stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"分析 Python 与 MEGAlib 可以使用不同 Python 版本。direct 在当前环境启动工具子进程；setup-script 在同一 Bash 子进程 source "
"指定脚本并执行工具。调用者环境与工作目录保持不变。"

msgid "Runtime initialization belongs to the child process."
msgstr "运行环境初始化发生在子进程中。"

msgid ""
"``MEGAlibRuntime`` owns process initialization, not data, analysis IDs, configuration or log-"
"capture options. Revan/Mimrec main configuration and baseline overrides belong in their "
"constructors; method overrides affect only one command. Native settings retain HOME by default, "
"with explicit isolation available per execution."
msgstr ""
"``MEGAlibRuntime`` 负责进程初始化，不持有数据、分析 ID、配置或日志捕获设置。Revan/Mimrec 主配置和基准覆盖属于构造函数；方法覆盖只作用于一条命令。默认保留原生 "
"HOME，也可逐次显式隔离设置。"

msgid ""
"``run_command`` reuses runtime startup for small standalone preparation tasks. It returns "
"``subprocess.CompletedProcess`` and bypasses managed workspace, manifest, output-discovery and "
"lineage handling. See :doc:`commands`."
msgstr ""
"``run_command`` 复用 runtime 启动，用于小型独立准备任务。它返回 ``subprocess.CompletedProcess``，绕过受管理的 "
"workspace、manifest、产物发现及来源登记。见 :doc:`commands`。"

msgid "Execution lifecycle and failures"
msgstr "执行生命周期与失败处理"

msgid ""
"Managed commands keep independent records through preparation, native execution and output "
"validation. A successful execution requires zero native exit status and nonempty expected "
"products; this checks operation, not scientific correctness."
msgstr "受管理命令从准备、原生执行到产物校验全程保留独立记录。成功要求原生零退出且预期产物非空，只验证操作结果，不证明科学正确性。"

msgid "Independent command records preserve success, failure and interruption."
msgstr "每条命令独立保存成功、失败和中断记录。"

msgid ""
"``ExecutionError`` exposes the manifest path and execution ID for failures after record creation."
" Early argument/allocation errors can occur before such a record exists. Keyboard interruption "
"records ``interrupted`` and propagates the interrupt; hard termination may leave an unfinished "
"record, which is never a successful input."
msgstr ""
"建立记录后的错误通过 ``ExecutionError`` 暴露 manifest 路径和 execution ID。早期参数/分配错误可能发生在记录建立前。键盘中断记录 "
"``interrupted`` 并继续传播；强制终止可能留下未完成记录，绝不作为成功输入。"

msgid ""
"Deleting a directory does not erase its manifest history. If a Revan/Mimrec group contains only "
"failed executions and its entire directory has been removed, the same analysis ID can accept "
"corrected constructor settings. The next execution rechecks eligibility under the lock, records "
"recovery history and retains old failures. Existing, successful or in-progress groups cannot "
"reset their definition this way. Cosima always requires a new workspace for a rerun, including "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"删除目录不会抹掉 manifest 历史。Revan/Mimrec 组只有失败执行，且整个组目录已删除时，可同一 analysis ID 更正构造设置。下次执行在锁内重查条件，记录 "
"recovery history 并保留旧失败。目录仍在、有成功或在途记录时不能如此重置。Cosima 任何重跑（包括失败）均需新 workspace。"

msgid "Compact inputs and log retention"
msgstr "精简输入与日志保留"

msgid ""
"By default source/cfg bytes and hashes live in the root manifest. Native input and launch files "
"are temporary. External orientation, geometry and spectrum resources remain shared; Cosima's "
"default zero hash limit records stat metadata without reading or copying nonempty resources. "
"Explicit archival can retain configuration files; setup scripts are always sourced from their "
"original path."
msgstr ""
"默认 source/cfg 原字节和 hash 保存在根 manifest，原生输入与启动文件临时存在。外部 orientation、geometry、spectrum 共享原文件；Cosima"
" 默认零 hash 上限只记录 stat，不读取或复制非空资源。显式归档可保留配置实体；setup 脚本始终从原路径 source。"

msgid "Compact configuration records and streaming Cosima summary logs."
msgstr "精简配置记录与流式 Cosima 摘要日志。"

msgid ""
"Select ``log_mode`` on the execution method. Cosima supports full or summary stdout capture; "
"summary retains every byte from the last line starting ``Summary for run`` through EOF, with no "
"size cap. Missing markers are recorded explicitly, and stderr is retained in full. Empty logs are"
" removed and their result paths become ``None``. Other tools currently use full capture."
msgstr ""
"在执行方法上选择 ``log_mode``。Cosima 支持 full 或 summary stdout；summary 从最后一个行首 ``Summary for run`` 到 EOF "
"完整保存，无大小上限。缺失标记明确记录，stderr 始终完整。空日志删除，结果路径变为 ``None``。其他工具目前使用 full。"

msgid "ROOT histograms and sky coordinates"
msgstr "ROOT 直方图与天空坐标"

msgid ""
"ROOT files remain native products until explicitly read. ``extract_spectrum`` and "
"``extract_image`` return detached arrays and metadata in memory. PyROOT runs only in a separate "
"compatible interpreter, never in the analysis Python process."
msgstr ""
"ROOT 文件在显式读取前保持原生产物。``extract_spectrum`` 与 ``extract_image`` 返回内存中的独立数组和元数据。PyROOT "
"仅在兼容的独立解释器加载，不进入分析 Python。"

msgid "Isolated ROOT reading preserves numerical data and environment boundaries."
msgstr "隔离 ROOT 读取，同时保留数值数据和环境边界。"

msgid ""
"The reader recursively discovers supported histograms by ROOT type and Directory/Canvas/Pad "
"hierarchy. Multiple candidates require explicit object selection. Spectrum bin edges and units "
"are retained. ``total_counts`` integrates only recognized counts/keV densities with keV widths, "
"or directly sums explicit counts; unknown conventions raise an error rather than silently "
"assigning counts."
msgstr ""
"读取器按 ROOT 类型及 Directory/Canvas/Pad 层级递归发现直方图。多候选需显式选对象。保留谱 bin 边界和单位。``total_counts`` 仅对已识别 "
"counts/keV 密度乘 keV 宽度积分，或对明确 counts 直接求和；未知约定报错，不静默当作计数。"

msgid ""
"``peak_position`` is the maximum-intensity pixel center, not a centroid or fit. "
"``peak_galactic_position`` returns Galactic ``SkyCoord`` only for a verified rectangular Galactic"
" axis mapping. Unknown/Hammer projections remain unmapped; longitude is determined from the "
"actual axis mapping, not a hardcoded sign rule. See :doc:`mimrec` for numerical contracts, "
"supported mappings and verification scope."
msgstr ""
"``peak_position`` 是最大强度像素中心，不是 centroid 或拟合位置。``peak_galactic_position`` 仅在验证矩形银河轴映射后返回 Galactic "
"``SkyCoord``。未知/Hammer 投影不映射；经度根据真实轴映射确定，不硬编码变号。数值契约、映射和验证范围见 :doc:`mimrec`。"

msgid "Implemented behavior and future extensions"
msgstr "已实现功能与后续扩展"

msgid "Scope of the current implementation"
msgstr "当前实现范围"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Capability"
msgstr "能力"

msgid "Implemented"
msgstr "已实现"

msgid ""
"Managed Cosima/Revan/Mimrec commands, named analysis definitions, exact result references, "
"component-aware extraction and root-manifest lineage."
msgstr "受管理的 Cosima/Revan/Mimrec 执行、命名分析定义、精确结果引用、包含外部成分的提取，以及根 manifest 来源链路。"

msgid ""
"Standalone native commands, prepared-component function composition, isolated ROOT extraction and"
" a configurable single-trial tutorial."
msgstr "独立原生命令、准备好成分的函数组合、隔离 ROOT 提取和可配置的单 trial 教程。"

msgid "Script responsibility"
msgstr "研究脚本负责"

msgid ""
"Research-specific background sampling, CSV study summaries and deciding the scientific validity "
"of inputs, selections and results."
msgstr "研究特有的背景抽样、CSV study 汇总，以及判断输入、筛选和结果的科学有效性。"

msgid "Future extensions"
msgstr "后续扩展"

msgid ""
"Study scheduling, a general workflow framework, execution-graph export and interactive lineage "
"browsing are not provided by the current package."
msgstr "当前包不提供 study 调度、通用 workflow 框架、执行图导出或交互式来源链路浏览。"

msgid "Limited mapping support"
msgstr "映射支持有限"

msgid ""
"General projection inversion, fitted localization positions and localization-uncertainty "
"estimation are not supplied by the image reader."
msgstr "图像读取器不提供通用投影逆变换、拟合定位或定位不确定度估计。"

msgid ""
"Native availability and scientific validation depend on the user's installation and data. Refer "
"to the operation guides and :doc:`api/index` for complete parameters and exceptions; the diagrams"
" explain responsibilities and data flow, not exhaustive validation of every native configuration "
"or projection."
msgstr "原生可用性与科学验证取决于用户安装及数据。完整参数和异常见各操作指南与 :doc:`api/index`。图示说明职责和数据流，不代表验证所有原生配置或投影。"

msgid ""
"``megalibpy`` connects source-file configuration, external MEGAlib commands and numerical "
"analysis through explicit data products. One experiment has one primary origin; a simulated "
"experiment contains one Cosima execution. Reconstruction and analysis can branch without "
"overwriting earlier results. This guide describes implemented behavior in the current development"
" documentation. Planned extensions are listed separately below."
msgstr ""
"``megalibpy`` 通过明确的数据产物连接源文件配置、外部 MEGAlib 命令和数值分析。一个实验有唯一主 origin；从模拟开始的实验包含一次 Cosima "
"执行。重建和分析可分支，且不覆盖已有结果。本页介绍当前开发文档对应的已实现行为，后续扩展在文末单独列出。"

msgid ""
"These diagrams explain the implemented design. They are not execution graphs automatically "
"generated from a workspace manifest."
msgstr "这些图说明已实现的设计，不是从 workspace manifest 自动生成的执行图。"
